rkers backwards. Each term of the determination must be no less favourable than the corresponding term of the agreement. It restores the position that your current agreement stays in place until you negotiate a new one.* See [OAF.org.au](https://www.openaustralia.org.au/senate/?gid=2025-08-28.30.1) for the full amendment text.","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-9718","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2025-08-28/5"}
